; Regression test for --account-rewrite and --payee-rewrite in a session,
; found while fixing #3253.
; https://github.com/ledger/ledger/issues/3253
;
; The rules these options give used to be added to the journal, beside the
; rules its account-rewrite and payee-rewrite directives declare.  In an
; interactive or --script session, which keeps one journal for every
; command, a rule given to one command therefore applied to every command
; after it, and came after the journal's rules instead of before them as
; on the command line; and reading the journal again (reload) lost the
; rules given at startup.  The rules now belong to the report: a command's
; own rules are tried first and apply to it alone.

account-rewrite Cash  Assets:Wallet

2021/12/31 Opening
    Assets:Broker                         1 AGGY
    Equity:Opening Balances

2022/01/04 Later
    Assets:Broker                         1 AGGY @@ $2.00
    Assets:Cash

; On the command line an option's rule is tried before a directive's.

test balance --account-rewrite Cash=Purse
              2 AGGY  Assets:Broker
             -1 AGGY  Equity:Opening Balances
                 $-2  Purse
--------------------
                 $-2
              1 AGGY
end test

; The script gives each rule to one command, between commands that give
; none, and reads the journal again (reload) before the last balance.

test --account-rewrite Opening=Equity:Start --script test/regress/3253_rewrite.dat
                 $-2
              2 AGGY  Assets
              2 AGGY    Broker
                 $-2    Wallet
             -1 AGGY  Equity:Start
--------------------
                 $-2
              1 AGGY
                 $-2  Assets:Wallet
             -1 AGGY  Equity:Start
              2 AGGY  Holdings
--------------------
                 $-2
              1 AGGY
                 $-2
              2 AGGY  Assets
              2 AGGY    Broker
                 $-2    Wallet
             -1 AGGY  Equity:Start
--------------------
                 $-2
              1 AGGY
              2 AGGY  Assets:Broker
             -1 AGGY  Equity:Start
                 $-2  Purse
--------------------
                 $-2
              1 AGGY
                 $-2
              2 AGGY  Assets
              2 AGGY    Broker
                 $-2    Wallet
             -1 AGGY  Equity:Start
--------------------
                 $-2
              1 AGGY
21-Dec-31 Opening               Assets:Broker                1 AGGY       1 AGGY
22-Jan-04 Purchase              Assets:Broker                1 AGGY       2 AGGY
21-Dec-31 Opening               Assets:Broker                1 AGGY       1 AGGY
22-Jan-04 Later                 Assets:Broker                1 AGGY       2 AGGY
end test
